    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: Vaisala Xweather (GitHub org `VaisalaCorp`)",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: AWS (used via `aws` CLI and the `remote-dev` EC2 dev-container tooling in this repo)",
      "**Repository visibility**: VaisalaCorp/xwe-ai-skills — internal (per gh); no classic protected branches listed, no rulesets listed either — treat `main` as unprotected only with caution since this is an internal (non-public) repo, not a confirmed-open one",
